@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title 系统执行取消、故障与显式恢复
actor "受信维护方" as Ops
participant "FlowEngine" as Engine
database "追加系统日志" as Journal
participant "业务程序" as Business
participant "外部权威服务" as External
== 显式系统终止 ==
Ops -> Engine : terminate(runId, reason)
Engine -> Journal : CAS追加Terminate
note right of Journal
旧回调被Running/epoch检查拒绝
已发出的外部动作不能撤回
end note
== 宿主崩溃 ==
Ops -> Ops : 确认原宿主进程结束
Ops -> Engine : recover(runId)
Engine -> Journal : CAS Running -> Yield
Ops -> Engine : run(相同版本与输入)
Engine -> Journal : Yield -> Ready -> 新Running代次
Engine -> Business : 从入口或业务检查点继续
Business -> Journal : Activity查询
alt Completed存在
  Journal --> Business : 回放结果，零次外部执行
else 只有Started
  Business --> Engine : 未知结果挂起
  Engine -> Journal : 追加Yield
  Ops -> External : 只读查询权威结果
  alt 凭据和结果已核验
    Ops -> Journal : reconcile追加Completed及证据引用
    Ops -> Engine : 显式恢复并回放
  else 仍然未知
    Ops -> Ops : 保持Yield，禁止重发
  end
end
@enduml
